{"id":"buildah-manifest-remove.1","n":"buildah-manifest-remove","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"buildah","ver":"1.39.4-2.el9_6","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/b/buildah-1.39.4-2.el9_6.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/buildah-manifest-remove.1.gz","sha256":"5a07ff0e380a3845ee1015e50b46dcd0b6a8d129f4bebefc9040e8772fccde2d","date":"September 2019","origin":"buildah"},"u":{"pkg":"buildah","ver":"1.23.1+ds1-2","repo":"jammy/universe","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/universe/g/golang-github-containers-buildah/buildah_1.23.1+ds1-2_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/buildah-manifest-remove.1.gz","sha256":"fa841be4e8b3a6b430b45aed376df2c51c2954b2cfc8611e33d940890b8c6f26","date":"September 2019","origin":"buildah"}},"nopt":{"r":0,"u":0},"desc":"Remove an image from a manifest list or image index.","same":false,"r":[["NAME","<p>buildah-manifest-remove - Remove an image from a manifest list or image index.</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>buildah manifest remove</b> <i>listNameOrIndexName</i> <i>imageNameOrManifestDigestOrArtifactName</i></p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>Removes the image with the specified name or digest from the specified manifest list or image index, or the specified artifact from the specified image index.</p>"],["RETURN VALUE","<p>The list image's ID and the digest of the removed image's manifest.</p>"],["EXAMPLE","<pre>buildah manifest remove mylist:v1.11 sha256:f81f09918379d5442d20dff82a298f29698197035e737f76e511d5af422cabd7\n506d8f4bb54931ea03a7e70173a0ed6302e3fb92dfadb3955ba5c17812e95c51: sha256:f81f09918379d5442d20dff82a298f29698197035e737f76e511d5af422cabd7\n</pre>"],["SEE ALSO","<p>buildah(1), buildah-manifest(1), buildah-manifest-create(1), buildah-manifest-add(1), buildah-manifest-annotate(1), buildah-manifest-inspect(1), buildah-manifest-push(1), buildah-rmi(1)</p>"]],"u":[["NAME",0],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>buildah manifest remove</b> <i>listNameOrIndexName</i> <i>imageManifestDigest</i></p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>Removes the image with the specified digest from the specified manifest list or image index.</p>"],["RETURN VALUE",3],["EXAMPLE","<div class=\"in\">  <pre>buildah manifest remove mylist:v1.11 sha256:f81f09918379d5442d20dff82a298f29698197035e737f76e511d5af422cabd7\n506d8f4bb54931ea03a7e70173a0ed6302e3fb92dfadb3955ba5c17812e95c51: sha256:f81f09918379d5442d20dff82a298f29698197035e737f76e511d5af422cabd7\n</pre> </div>"],["SEE ALSO",5]],"diff":{"r":[],"u":[]}}